==Excluded monsters==
Despite appearing to be ghosts, many creatures with the spectral attribute do not have the undead attribute, including all [[wight]]s (such as the [[Barrows brothers]]), the [[barbarian spirit]]s in the [[Ancient Cavern]], [[ghast]]s, [[spiritual creature]]s, and reanimated creatures from [[ensouled head]]s.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/856458661308379136|date=24 April 2017|quote=No, reanimated creatures don't count as undead. The Barrows brothers are a fairly good comparison.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200430154805/https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/856458661308379136|archivedate=April 30 2020}}

Other non-spectral exceptions include [[ghoul]]s, [[Ba-Ba]] and her undead [[baboon]]s, [[skeletal wyverns]] (as they are simply reanimated bones), and [[vampyre]]s (although they are often portrayed as undead in other media, they are not undead in ''RuneScape'').

